      equipment: '106 Burako tiles with racks, table space for melds',
      dealing: 'Tiles mixed face down. Each player draws 11 tiles onto their rack. Two face-down stacks of 11 tiles (muertos) set aside. Remaining 40 tiles form stock in four piles of 10.',
