    turnFlow: 'First player draws, decides to keep or discard, then may meld and discards. Other players: draw from stock or take all discards; optionally meld escaleras (same-color sequences) or piernas (same-number sets); discard one tile. First player to empty hand takes a muerto (11-tile extra hand). Team can go out after taking muerto and having at least one canasta.',
