    exampleHands: [
      'Setup example: 0 card(s) per player.',
      'Rule example: Be the first team to reach 3000+ points by melding tiles into sequences and sets, creating canastas (7+ tile melds), and going out.',
      'Turn-flow example: First player draws, decides to keep or discard, then may meld and discards. Other players: draw from stock or take all discards; optionally meld escaleras (same-color sequences) or piernas (same-number sets); discard one tile. First player to empty hand takes a muerto (11-tile extra hand). Team can go out after taking muerto and having at least one canasta.',
      'Scoring example: At the end of each hand both teams total the tile values of all tiles in their melds, subtract the values of tiles left in hand, and apply bonuses and penalties for canastas, going out, and unused muertos. Teams accumulate scores over multiple hands; when a team reaches or exceeds 3000 points, the team with the higher total score wins the game..',
